WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:01.488
Three risks rate high.

2
00:00:01.488 --> 00:00:04.760
Accreditation slips: start
the package in Phase zero,

3
00:00:04.760 --> 00:00:08.999
and a twelve-month slip still leaves
the case better than the refresh,

4
00:00:08.999 --> 00:00:13.163
by about forty-seven million, though
break-even moves past year five.

5
00:00:13.163 --> 00:00:17.687
Circuit cost comes in below the
assumption: validate it before submission.

6
00:00:17.687 --> 00:00:20.469
And replacement telemetry lags a cutover:

7
00:00:20.469 --> 00:00:24.363
begin coordination in Phase zero
and gate each office on it.

8
00:00:24.363 --> 00:00:27.388
Ten assumptions in all
are ordered by impact.

9
00:00:27.388 --> 00:00:31.874
Check circuit cost, endpoint count
and terrestrial availability first.

10
00:00:31.874 --> 00:00:35.045
The architectural conclusion
holds across the range;

11
00:00:35.045 --> 00:00:37.920
the financial one depends
on the circuit number.
